  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 57789920567296
    m_Localized: Starting burger stand. Owned from the start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927424
    m_Localized: A full burger house with a wider front and more room for decorations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927425
    m_Localized: Sweet as honey and twice as cuddly when the fries arrive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927426
    m_Localized: Grilled to perfection, this patty is well done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927427
    m_Localized: Rare, uncooked, and beefing for the griddle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927428
    m_Localized: Small menu board standing next to the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927429
    m_Localized: Tall advertising board out in front of the shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927430
    m_Localized: Stacked, layered, and absolutely on a roll.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927431
    m_Localized: Fry the ingredients until golden brown and crispy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927432
    m_Localized: Pours fizzy cola.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927433
    m_Localized: Chops ingredients into pieces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927434
    m_Localized: Toasted bun with buns of steel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927435
    m_Localized: A bun that finally opened up about its feelings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927436
    m_Localized: A soft bun still loafing around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927437
    m_Localized: Where ingredients come from.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927438
    m_Localized: Restaurant sign board mounted above the roofline.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927439
    m_Localized: Too cool to hurry and always orders with a perfectly timed purr.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927440
    m_Localized: Tiny paws, big appetite and absolutely no shame about extra cheese.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927441
    m_Localized: A block of dairy with grate potential.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927442
    m_Localized: Sliced cheese, ready to melt some hearts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927443
    m_Localized: Molten gold that makes everything grate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927444
    m_Localized: Breast dressed in flour, ready for its crispy debut.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927445
    m_Localized: Plain and pale, still waiting for its big fry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927446
    m_Localized: Crispy outside, juicy inside, finger-clucking good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927447
    m_Localized: A little nugget wearing its floury armor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927448
    m_Localized: Small, bite-sized, and dreaming of the deep fryer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927449
    m_Localized: Thigh in a flour coat, thicc and ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927450
    m_Localized: The juiciest cut, still hiding its potential.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927451
    m_Localized: Wings battered up before they learn to fly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927452
    m_Localized: A wing with no crunch to its name yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927453
    m_Localized: Red dust that brings the heat, no chill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927454
    m_Localized: Green stalks with a mild case of onion envy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927455
    m_Localized: Tiny green confetti for a crispy celebration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927456
    m_Localized: An empty cup with a thirst for purpose.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927457
    m_Localized: Dark fizzy soda bubbling with excitement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927458
    m_Localized: Cola on ice, served with the cold shoulder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927459
    m_Localized: Stacked to order and best eaten before the bun gives up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927460
    m_Localized: Ice cold bubbles that make every bite of the burger louder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927461
    m_Localized: Golden outside, juicy inside and gone in about four bites.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927462
    m_Localized: Hot, salty and impossible to share fairly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927463
    m_Localized: A loyal little diner who treats every burger like a tail-wagging treasure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927464
    m_Localized: Fragile, but it will crack under pressure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927465
    m_Localized: Sunny side up and eggs-tremely cheerful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927466
    m_Localized: Fries food until golden brown and crispy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927467
    m_Localized: Coats ingredients in a layer of batter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927468
    m_Localized: Water that decided to play it cool.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927469
    m_Localized: Everything crispy, boxed into one glorious clucking feast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927470
    m_Localized: Crisp green leaves, so lettuce begin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927471
    m_Localized: Shredded greens that finally leafed the head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927472
    m_Localized: A whole head of very level-headed greens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927473
    m_Localized: String lights strung along the left side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927474
    m_Localized: Restaurant sign board mounted above the roofline.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927475
    m_Localized: Runs the lunch rush like a boardroom and demands premium pickles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927476
    m_Localized: Potted plant beside the entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927477
    m_Localized: A humble spud with fry-star ambitions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927478
    m_Localized: Sliced into sticks, now a fry in waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927479
    m_Localized: Golden fries hot enough to spark a salt debate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927480
    m_Localized: Fries buried under cheese, no regrets whatsoever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927481
    m_Localized: Bounces in hungry and leaves with crumbs on both cheeks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927482
    m_Localized: The fastest red-tailed courier in town unless someone drops a fry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927483
    m_Localized: Purple, pungent, and secretly emotional.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927484
    m_Localized: Sliced rings that made the chef cry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927485
    m_Localized: An oversized burger prop sitting on top of the roof.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927486
    m_Localized: Sign hanging off the right side of the building.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927487
    m_Localized: Sign hanging off the right side of the building.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927488
    m_Localized: Round, red, and technically a fruit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927489
    m_Localized: Juicy slices with nothing left to ketchup on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57789949927490
    m_Localized: Hanging vines trailing over the roof edge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
