  - m_Id: 3010520264204288
    m_Localized: Chops veggies faster than a lettuce can blush.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010520297758720
    m_Localized: Slice, dice, done. Onions never stood a chance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010520297758721
    m_Localized: Pours fizzy cola in a flash, bubbles and all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010520297758722
    m_Localized: Big fizz! A fountain of soda and joy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010520297758723
    m_Localized: Coats chicken in flour at top speed. Messy but tasty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010520297758724
    m_Localized: A snowstorm of flour. Every nugget gets a cozy blanket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010520297758725
    m_Localized: Golden fries in record time. Crunch guaranteed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010520297758726
    m_Localized: Extra crispiness unlocked. The fries glow with pride.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010520297758727
    m_Localized: Patties sizzle faster. Stomachs growl louder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3010520297758728
    m_Localized: So hot that burgers flip for it. Literally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
