  - m_Id: 8069138441297920
    m_Localized: Lettuce is shredded before it even lands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069138487435264
    m_Localized: Samurai Chopper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069138491629568
    m_Localized: So sharp it slices the air. Tomatoes salute.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069138491629569
    m_Localized: Legendary Blade Board
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069138491629570
    m_Localized: It erupts with fizz. Cups fill themselves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069138491629571
    m_Localized: Cola Volcano
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069138491629572
    m_Localized: Bubbles forever. Thirst doesn't stand a chance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069138491629573
    m_Localized: Infinite Fizz Fountain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8069138491629574
    m_Localized: Coats nuggets faster than you can say crunch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
